#. module: boss_portal
#: model:mail.template,body_html:boss_portal.email_template_rate_quotation
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"    <p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"        Hello,\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Your rates <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" t-out=\"object.name or ''\">S00052</span>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"object.client_order_ref\">(<t t-out=\"object.client_order_ref or ''\">CUSTOMER REF</t>)</t>\n"
"        are ready for review: each price applies per container of its size and type, per B/L or per the unit shown on\n"
"        each line.\n"
"        <t t-if=\"object.validity_date\">They are valid until <t t-out=\"format_date(object.validity_date) or ''\">05/05/2026</t>.</t>\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        To book, tell us the containers you will ship, or use «Request booking» on the quotation if you are an\n"
"        authorised representative.\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        Do not hesitate to contact us if you have any questions.\n"
"        <t t-if=\"not is_html_empty(object.user_id.signature)\">\n"
"            <div data-o-mail-quote=\"1\">--<br data-o-mail-quote=\"1\"/><t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature or ''\">Mitchell Admin</t></div>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "
msgstr "<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n        Hola,\n        <br/><br/>\n        Sus tarifas <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" t-out=\"object.name or ''\">S00052</span>\n        <t t-if=\"object.client_order_ref\">(<t t-out=\"object.client_order_ref or ''\">CUSTOMER REF</t>)</t>\n        están listas para revisar: cada precio se aplica por contenedor de su tamaño y tipo, por B/L o por la unidad indicada en\n        cada línea.\n        <t t-if=\"object.validity_date\">Son válidas hasta el <t t-out=\"format_date(object.validity_date) or ''\">05/05/2026</t>.</t>\n        <br/><br/>\n        Para reservar, indíquenos los contenedores que va a embarcar, o use «Solicitar reserva» en la oferta si es\n        representante autorizado.\n        <br/><br/>\n        No dude en contactarnos si tiene cualquier pregunta.\n        <t t-if=\"not is_html_empty(object.user_id.signature)\">\n            <div data-o-mail-quote=\"1\">--<br data-o-mail-quote=\"1\"/><t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature or ''\">Mitchell Admin</t></div>\n        </t>\n    </p>\n</div>\n            "

