#. module: boss_portal
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_boss_portal
msgid ""
"Customer portal on the standard Odoo portal: roles granted by BOSS "
"(tracking, commercial, authorised representative), quotations and invoices "
"of the customer's own legal entity, rate quotations without totals, booking "
"requests reviewed by BOSS, My Shipments with published events and documents,"
" and a revocable tracking link. BOSS costs and margins never reach the "
"customer (ADR-010)."
msgstr "Portal de clientes sobre el portal estándar de Odoo: roles concedidos por BOSS (seguimiento, comercial, representante autorizado), ofertas y facturas de la propia entidad legal del cliente, ofertas de tarifas sin totales, solicitudes de reserva revisadas por BOSS, Mis envíos con novedades y documentos publicados, y un enlace de seguimiento revocable. Los costes y márgenes de BOSS nunca llegan al cliente (ADR-010)."

